/F2 14 Tf
45 716 Td
(4. Things that bite) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 698 Td
(Adding a flight is not idempotent. A retried POST /flights creates a second row. If your) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 686 Td
(app retries on timeout, either read the flight list first, or keep the id you got back) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 674 Td
(and switch to PUT.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 663 Td
({ref} may contain a space. IS 40475 works, but URL-encode it \(IS%2040475\). The server) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 651 Td
(normalises spaces away either way.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 640 Td
(Cancellation is a request, not an act. 202 Accepted and PENDING_CANCELLATION mean the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 628 Td
(accounts team still has to approve. Do not show your users "cancelled" until GET) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 616 Td
(/bookings/{ref} reports CANCELLED.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 605 Td
(email_sent: false is not a failure of the cancellation. The request is recorded either) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 593 Td
(way; only the notification failed. Surface it to ops, do not retry the cancellation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 582 Td
(Service tokens need X-File-Handler. Forgetting it is 400 ACT_AS_REQUIRED, not a 401 -) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 570 Td
(the token is fine, it just does not know who it is acting for.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 559 Td
(Approval is re-checked on every call. Deactivating a handler in the admin screen kills) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 547 Td
(their API access immediately, mid-token.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 536 Td
(Token TTL is 12 hours and there is no refresh. Cache the token, watch expires_at, and) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 524 Td
(log in again when it lapses.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 513 Td
(Extraction costs money. Every /flights/extract call is a GPT-4o request logged to) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.8 Tf
45 501 Td
(AiUsageLog. Do not put it in a polling loop.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
45 482 Td
